{"id": "EUVD-2026-102816", "enisaUuid": "63266b20-08e0-3abd-bb07-9d648301b153", "description": "The FiboSearch \u2013 Ajax Search for WooCommerce plugin for WordPress is vulnerable to Stored Cross-Site Scripting via the 'purchased_plan' parameter in all versions up to, and including, 1.34.2 due to insufficient input sanitization and output escaping. This makes it possible for authenticated attackers, with subscriber-level access and above, to inject arbitrary web scripts in pages that will execute whenever a user accesses an injected page. Exploitation requires that the site owner has previously completed the standard Freemius opt-in flow; once that condition is met, any Subscriber can reach the vulnerable handler simply by loading /wp-admin/profile.php with the requisite query parameters.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T07:44:02", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T14:15:55", "baseScore": 6.4, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:N", "references": ["https://www.wordfence.com/threat-intel/vulnerabilities/id/7db3475a-3a70-4776-8ea3-337192f88973?source=cve", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/ajax-search-for-woocommerce/tags/1.34.2/vendor/freemius/wordpress-sdk/includes/class-freemius.php#L4548", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/ajax-search-for-woocommerce/tags/1.34.2/vendor/freemius/wordpress-sdk/includes/fs-core-functions.php#L223", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/ajax-search-for-woocommerce/tags/1.34.2/vendor/freemius/wordpress-sdk/includes/managers/class-fs-admin-notice-manager.php#L421", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/ajax-search-for-woocommerce/tags/1.34.2/vendor/freemius/wordpress-sdk/templates/admin-notice.php#L110", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/ajax-search-for-woocommerce/tags/1.34.2/vendor/freemius/wordpress-sdk/includes/fs-html-escaping-functions.php#L123", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/ajax-search-for-woocommerce/tags/1.34.2/assets/js/admin.js#L555", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/ajax-search-for-woocommerce/tags/1.34.2/assets/js/tooltip.min.js#L4", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset?reponame=&new=3734423%40ajax-search-for-woocommerce%2Ftags%2F1.34.3&old=3684506%40ajax-search-for-woocommerce%2Ftags%2F1.34.2"], "aliases": ["GHSA-xmfq-pgq5-whgc", "CVE-2026-100106"], "assigner": "Wordfence", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "04bc2a51-8e57-3edb-adda-7119bb54b28f", "product": {"name": "FiboSearch \u2013 Ajax Search for WooCommerce", "vendor": {"name": "damian-gora"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.34.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9303d572-5e7d-339e-85db-00fc21f068eb", "vendor": {"name": "damian-gora"}}], "isExploited": false}